                                  LASTDRIVE=
 
Sets the highest drive letter programs should look for.

\bSyntax\p

    LASTDRIVE=x

\bParameters\p

x
    A letter, up to P.  LASTDRIVE never goes below the drives the
    machine has, and adds none.  Without the line, every letter.

